    "text": "Equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;has real solution, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>sin</mi><mi>t</mi></math> can be",
